From cd67998b0bac1b26e8e41634ab4b8a7170c424ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Philipp Mundhenk <philipp@mundhenk.org>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 20:04:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] udev: also give the group lp access to the printers

TAG+="uaccess" only covers users logged in at the console. With GROUP="lp"
a service (a web interface, a print server) can print when its user is in the
group lp, without running as root.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
